{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜中美外長通話／美股上升　科技股反彈\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-CN-US-261112A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月12日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【促加強溝通】中美外長通話，王毅表示中方願同美方加強溝通合作，處理敏感問題。</p><p>【科技股反彈】美股標普同納指收市升逾百分之一，英偉達股價反彈。</p><p>【稱胞弟殺人】蔡天鳳碎屍案續審，鄺港傑作供稱胞弟鄺港智殺死蔡天鳳。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:46:23.136114+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:00:02.587638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:39:51.611773+00:00","content_hash":"dbd52e9f69ed133631cf6f32144e7825ef4b628d166d68ec2fe7d16d3b165922","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}